      "Title": "Exam D-UN-DY-23 topic 1 question 1 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A storage administrator must configure replication from a production Dell Unity XT 680F to an offsite DR Dell Unity XT 480. Block resources must be replicated without data loss if the production site becomes unavailable. File resources can be replicated with an acceptable amount of data difference on the destination."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What replication configuration meets the requirements?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Set Unisphere resource filtering to All."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Configure the replication connection mode to Both."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Set an RPO of 0 on the synchronous replication sessions."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Configure the replication interfaces on the 4-port mezzanine card."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: B \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": []
      },
      "Vote_count": [
        {
          "voted_answers": "B",
